      "summaries": {
        "en": "Turbovec is a high-performance vector index library built on TurboQuant, designed for fast approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) search in embedding spaces. Its key technical innovation is leveraging AVX512 and NEON SIMD instructions alongside Rust's zero-cost abstractions to achieve blazing-fast quantization and search. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for FAISS in RAG pipelines or similarity search applications, benefiting from its Python bindings and MIT license.",
        "zh": "Turbovec 是一个基于 TurboQuant 的高性能向量索引库，专为嵌入空间中的快速近似最近邻（ANN）搜索而设计。其核心技术亮点在于利用 AVX512 和 NEON SIMD 指令集，结合 Rust 的零成本抽象，实现了极快的量化和搜索速度。你可以将其作为 FAISS 的替代品，用于 RAG 流水线或相似性搜索应用中，得益于其 Python 绑定和 MIT 许可证，集成非常方便。",
        "es": "Turbovec is a high-performance vector index library built on TurboQuant, designed for fast approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) search in embedding spaces. Its key technical innovation is leveraging AVX512 and NEON SIMD instructions alongside Rust's zero-cost abstractions to achieve blazing-fast quantization and search. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for FAISS in RAG pipelines or similarity search applications, benefiting from its Python bindings and MIT license.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "turbovec stands out for ann, avx512, and embedding in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Turbovec is a high-performance vector index library built on TurboQuant, designed for fast approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) search in embedding spaces. Its key technical innovation is leveraging AVX512 and NEON SIMD instructions alongside Rust's zero-cost abstractions to achieve blazing-fast quantization and search. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for FAISS in RAG pipelines or similarity search applications, benefiting from its Python bindings and MIT license.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/RyanCodrai/turbovec for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
