      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) multimodal model that activates only 3B parameters per token while retaining 35B total capacity. It excels at image-text-to-text tasks, supporting multilingual input and uncensored outputs. Technically, its sparse MoE design enables efficient inference on consumer GPUs. Use it for vision-language applications like image captioning, visual QA, or creative content generation. The GGUF quantization further reduces memory footprint, making it practical for local deployment.",
        "zh": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B是一款混合专家（MoE）多模态模型，总参数量35B，每次推理仅激活3B参数，显著降低计算成本。它支持图像与文本联合理解，可处理中英文等多语言输入，采用无审查输出策略。技术亮点在于稀疏MoE架构，通过路由网络动态选择专家子网络，兼顾大模型知识容量与高效推理。该模型适用于图像描述、视觉问答、多模态内容生成等场景。社区提供的GGUF量化版本进一步压缩体积，使普通消费级GPU也能运行。用户可直接加载预训练权重进行零样本推理，或基于视觉编",
        "es": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) multimodal model that activates only 3B parameters per token while retaining 35B total capacity. It excels at image-text-to-text tasks, supporting multilingual input and uncensored outputs. Technically, its sparse MoE design enables efficient inference on consumer GPUs. Use it for vision-language applications like image captioning, visual QA, or creative content generation. The GGUF quantization further reduces memory footprint, making it practical for local deployment.",
        "sections": {
