          "what": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) multimodal model that activates only 3B parameters per token while retaining 35B total capacity. It excels at image-text-to-text tasks, supporting multilingual input and uncensored outputs. Technically, its sparse MoE design enables efficient inference on consumer GPUs. Use it for vision-language applications like image captioning, visual QA, or creative content generation. The GGUF quantization further reduces memory footprint, making it practical for local deployment.",
